findings.proposal:
Load the cwd root's value once and reuse it when the main root is the same path:
```rust
let cwd_value = plugin_value(cwd_root);
let enabled = match main_root {
    Some(main) if main != cwd_root => enabled_from_value(plugin_value(main).as_ref()),
    _ => enabled_from_value(cwd_value.as_ref()),
};
PluginConfig { enabled, gate: gate_from_value(cwd_value.as_ref()) }
```

